# mexc-cli — AI Agent Rules (legacy Cursor entry; new format lives in .cursor/rules/)

The single source of truth is AGENTS.md. Read it before writing any skill, API wrapper, or code.

## English-only (non-negotiable)

Everything written into this repository is English-only — Go identifiers, comments, string
literals, log messages, commit messages, MR/PR descriptions (Conventional Commits in English),
skill files, and docs. No CJK anywhere. CI enforces this via scripts/check-english.py; any CJK
character in changed Go lines or the commit message turns the pipeline red.

## Everything else

See AGENTS.md (hard contracts) and CONTRIBUTING.md (how to add a directory). Run the local
checks in AGENTS.md §6 before opening an MR.
